OL,5,G0125 Cold Case Killers
OL,6,     FIn 1979, 22-year-old Teresa de
OL,7,     FSimone is found murdered in the
OL,8,     Fback of her car. Sean Hodgson is
OL,9,     Ffound guilty and sentenced to life
OL,10,     Fbut hopes that new DNA technology
OL,11,     Fwill clear his name.
OL,12,G0220 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FA drunken driver is in the fast
OL,14,     Flane of the M6, dog handler Glenn
OL,15,     Fis given a crash course in marine
OL,16,     Frescue, and Duggie is called to
OL,17,     Fthe scene of a crash.
